NV_PK(32,{"a close look at the gable of dacheng hall at the top is the white hanging fish ornament shaped like a vase with tassels under the eaves are a blue and white painted band two rows of round tile ends and a lattice vent on each side lies an s shaped iron bar with curled ends that is a wall anchor it passes through the wall and ties it to the wooden beams inside so the wall cannot lean outward": ""})